        "note": "Ships within 2–4 working days. Free delivery on orders over $80.",
        "description_label": "Description",
        "description_content": "<p>A standard-fit E27 bulb built to a colour standard most are not. The KAYVA E27 Dim runs at 2700K warm white, spreads light across a wide 160° for pendants, table lamps, and exposed fittings, and dims smoothly on the standard TRIAC leading-edge dimmers already fitted in most Singapore homes.<br/><br/>It renders at Ra95+ with R9 above 50, so reds, skin tones, timber, and fabrics look the way they actually do — not washed out or shifted cool. R9 is the spec most bulbs quietly fail: standard CRI (Ra) averages eight pastel samples and skips saturated red, where most LEDs score zero or negative. KAYVA holds R9 above 50.<br/><br/>At 9W it delivers 1013 lumens and is rated to 25,000 hours at L70 — running eight hours a day, that is over eight years. High colour rendering means fewer lumens than a bargain bulb of the same wattage; that is the deliberate trade-off for light that shows finishes and</p>"
      }
